---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Uses" description="The hardware, software, and homelab Staple uses every day.">
  <div class="wrap page-head">
    <h1>Uses</h1>
    <p>What I build on, run, and type into every day.</p>
  </div>
  <section class="wrap section" style="padding-top:2.5rem">
    <div class="two-col">
      <div class="panel reveal">
        <h2>Small form factor builds</h2>
        <p class="muted">I like fitting full desktop power into the smallest case it'll survive in. Most of the fun is in the planning: airflow, cable routing, and finding parts that physically fit.</p>
        <!-- Add build specs here (case, CPU, GPU, cooling) when you want them public. -->
      </div>
      <div class="panel reveal">
        <h2>Desktop</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Arch Linux with Hyprland (<a href="https://github.com/StapleTT/T1-dots">dotfiles</a>)</li>
          <li>fish shell with Starship</li>
          <li>Neovim</li>
          <li>Fedora with my <a href="https://github.com/StapleTT/cyb-fedora">cyb-fedora</a> scripts for security lab work</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="panel reveal">
        <h2>Homelab</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Proxmox VE with LXC containers and Docker</li>
          <li>NGINX reverse proxy with Let's Encrypt TLS</li>
          <li>WireGuard for remote access</li>
          <li>Pi-hole for network-wide ad blocking</li>
          <li>Raspberry Pis for smaller jobs (one runs the <a href="/projects/tack/">tack</a> bridge)</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:1rem"><a href="/projects/homelab/">Homelab write-up →</a></p>
      </div>
      <div class="panel reveal">
        <h2>Tools I like</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Git and GitHub</li>
          <li>Wireshark and TShark</li>
          <li>nmap</li>
          <li>Docker Compose</li>
          <li>Android Studio</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
